{"4914580":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SURA: Shattered Star","steam_appid":4914580,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/ced6a78053acfea1364da4a004e2d50e.avif?t=1787151797\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras_big\/ced6a78053acfea1364da4a004e2d50e.webp?t=1787151797 width=1560 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Blade Drawn Against the Empire<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURA: Shattered Star<\/strong> is a fast-paced 2D action platformer combining Asterium-powered sword combat, fluid movement, and a space opera setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the war, Sura lives as a mercenary. During a mission to infiltrate a pirate vessel, she discovers traces of forbidden human experiments connected to the Empire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue the Doctor behind the experiments as Sura travels through a pirate vessel, an underground laboratory, a former Imperial military base converted into a research facility, and the Doctor’s ship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through the enemies standing in your way and uncover the truth behind the experiments involving Asterium, as well as the past Sura has kept hidden.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a55a92952276b8dbbfbddfffd4c7d280.apng?t=1787151797\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a55a92952276b8dbbfbddfffd4c7d280.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Power of Asterium<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura wields a single sword and draws upon the power of Asterium to perform devastating quick-draw techniques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move rapidly between enemies, mark them with precise slashes, and sheathe your sword at the decisive moment to unleash a powerful finishing attack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly chain movement and attacks together, exploit enemy openings, and cut through multiple targets without losing the flow of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp reflexes, precise positioning, and careful timing are the keys to survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced 2D Action Platforming<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and movement are designed to flow together as one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through enemy attacks, leap across dangerous terrain, slide beneath obstacles, and carry your momentum into the next strike.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hazards without slowing down, move rapidly between targets, and carve a path through groups of enemies before they can surround you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful bosses await at the end of each chapter, including heavily armored combatants, massive mechanical weapons, and autonomous war machines with unique attack patterns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Sura’s movement and sword techniques to defeat them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Space Opera of Revenge, Survival, and Guilt<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura is not a chosen hero.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a swordswoman of the <strong>Goh Dynasty<\/strong>, she survived the war that brought her homeland under Imperial rule, but was officially recorded among the dead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now living as a mercenary, she pursues the Doctor in search of an answer to the survivor’s guilt that continues to haunt her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not because the Doctor is directly connected to her survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura wants to believe that killing the Doctor is the reason she was allowed to survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete her revenge, Sura must overcome not only the enemies standing in her way, but also the guilt and wounds she has carried since the war.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed over approximately two months as a final project at <strong>KRAFTON Jungle Game Lab<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a free proof of concept created to explore and validate the game’s core combat mechanics, movement systems, visual direction, and narrative potential within a limited development period.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than representing a full-scale commercial production, this project is intended as a playable showcase of the concepts and gameplay direction that form the foundation of <strong>SURA: Shattered Star<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the world we have created and the potential this project represents.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/ced6a78053acfea1364da4a004e2d50e.avif?t=1787151797\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras_big\/ced6a78053acfea1364da4a004e2d50e.webp?t=1787151797 width=1560 height=800 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Blade Drawn Against the Empire<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURA: Shattered Star<\/strong> is a fast-paced 2D action platformer combining Asterium-powered sword combat, fluid movement, and a space opera setting.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the war, Sura lives as a mercenary. During a mission to infiltrate a pirate vessel, she discovers traces of forbidden human experiments connected to the Empire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pursue the Doctor behind the experiments as Sura travels through a pirate vessel, an underground laboratory, a former Imperial military base converted into a research facility, and the Doctor’s ship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through the enemies standing in your way and uncover the truth behind the experiments involving Asterium, as well as the past Sura has kept hidden.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a55a92952276b8dbbfbddfffd4c7d280.apng?t=1787151797\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a55a92952276b8dbbfbddfffd4c7d280.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Power of Asterium<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura wields a single sword and draws upon the power of Asterium to perform devastating quick-draw techniques.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move rapidly between enemies, mark them with precise slashes, and sheathe your sword at the decisive moment to unleash a powerful finishing attack.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly chain movement and attacks together, exploit enemy openings, and cut through multiple targets without losing the flow of battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp reflexes, precise positioning, and careful timing are the keys to survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/a3804314042a136a67ea81c3656887c4.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced 2D Action Platforming<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat and movement are designed to flow together as one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through enemy attacks, leap across dangerous terrain, slide beneath obstacles, and carry your momentum into the next strike.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hazards without slowing down, move rapidly between targets, and carve a path through groups of enemies before they can surround you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful bosses await at the end of each chapter, including heavily armored combatants, massive mechanical weapons, and autonomous war machines with unique attack patterns.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master Sura’s movement and sword techniques to defeat them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/4bbcbf336038f0d43d6402146117e540.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Space Opera of Revenge, Survival, and Guilt<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura is not a chosen hero.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a swordswoman of the <strong>Goh Dynasty<\/strong>, she survived the war that brought her homeland under Imperial rule, but was officially recorded among the dead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now living as a mercenary, she pursues the Doctor in search of an answer to the survivor’s guilt that continues to haunt her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not because the Doctor is directly connected to her survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sura wants to believe that killing the Doctor is the reason she was allowed to survive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete her revenge, Sura must overcome not only the enemies standing in her way, but also the guilt and wounds she has carried since the war.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.poster.avif?t=1787151797\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.webm?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4914580\/extras\/02c728bade64341af080cc4840eb65db.mp4?t=1787151797\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed over approximately two months as a final project at <strong>KRAFTON Jungle Game Lab<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a free proof of concept created to explore and validate the game’s core combat mechanics, movement systems, visual direction, and narrative potential within a limited development period.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rather than representing a full-scale commercial production, this project is intended as a playable showcase of the concepts and gameplay direction that form the foundation of <strong>SURA: Shattered Star<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy the world we have created and the potential this project represents.<\/p>","short_de